<title>MALAYSIA: Nylex (Malaysia) 1996 net profit up.</title>
<headline>Nylex (Malaysia) 1996 net profit up.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec. 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 56.28	 vs	   55.01</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	25.07	 vs	   24.50</p>
<p>    Turnover		  578.28	vs	   468.56</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   82.11	vs	    77.20</p>
<p>    Minorities less	   2.30	vs	     1.49</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)	 15.75	vs	    14.67</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Nylex (Malaysia) Bhd. It makes chemical films and coated fabrics.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 201 4813)</p>
</text>
